{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/533672-are-cults-supposed-to-have-tiny-dicepools","id":533672,"title":"Are Cults supposed to have tiny dicepools?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-30T15:14:06-07:00","id":533672,"title":"Are Cults supposed to have tiny dicepools?","content":"Am I missing something somewhere in the rules, or are Cults really supposed to act just by rolling Reach or Grasp as dicepools? It seems horribly unlikely that they'd ever get anything done with a maximum of five dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T15:22:44-07:00","id":533692,"title":"","content":"The way my games have gone, Cults only ever attempt to do things that are within their limits (in other words, nothing beyond the level at which they automatically succeed). That way, the only time they ever have to roll is when going up against a Cult acting against them, and the pools are at least comparable there.<br /> <br /> But yes, the pools are tiny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T19:37:50-07:00","id":533925,"title":"","content":"You might want to adapt the rules from damnation city if you don't find cults useful enough- in damnation city ones following have skills that get paired with their master's attributes, so you can say have your cult eliminate someone with melee or firearms, build a trap with crafts, fix an election with politics, translate a text with academics, steal something with larceny, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}